# toml-lite: array table parsing — assert specific fields
[include %libdir "toml-lite.llt"]

---

[match [call %.parse-toml-lite "[[items]]\nname = \"first\"\n[[items]]\nname = \"second\""]
  [case [let parsed] [Result.Ok parsed] [get "name" [get 1 [get "items" parsed]]]]
  [case [let msg]   [Result.Error msg]  [raise msg]]]
=== out
String("second")
